commmerce.com/blog/commmerceui/.

"**Commmerce Platform**" means the products, services, infrastructure and applications operated or provided
by Commmerce.

"**Commmerce Software**" means software developed to run on, integrate with, extend or provide functionality
for a Commmerce Platform, including applications listed in or privately installed through the Commmerce app
marketplace, and internal business applications used in connection with a Commmerce Platform.

"**You**" means the individual or legal entity exercising rights under this licence, including its
authorised employees, contractors, consultants and agencies acting on its behalf solely for the
development, maintenance or operation of Commmerce Software.

