Upon termination, you must cease using and distributing the Packages and remove them from systems under
your control, except to the extent retention is required by applicable law.

Where reasonably practicable and where termination does not arise from a security or intellectual property
violation, Commmerce may permit a limited transition period for existing merchant applications.

Termination does not affect rights or obligations accrued before termination.

Sections 4, 5, 7, 8, 9 and this section survive termination.

